1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:17,490
Datawhale-EAI builds Physical AI on AMD ROCm.
Datawhale-EAI 在 AMD ROCm 上构建 Physical AI。

2
00:00:17,990 --> 00:00:36,460
One AMD stack connects data, policy, physics, and proof across physical worlds.
一套 AMD 技术栈，连接数据、策略、物理与结果。

3
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:58,590
RoboCasa365 brings household manipulation to a shared mobile benchmark.
RoboCasa365 将家庭操作带入统一的移动操作基准。

4
00:00:59,090 --> 00:01:21,230
Long-horizon traces reveal every step from approach to placement.
长时序轨迹展示从接近目标到完成放置的每一步。

5
00:01:21,730 --> 00:01:46,650
DexJoCo brings contact-rich dexterous control to native JAX on AMD ROCm.
DexJoCo 在 AMD ROCm 原生 JAX 上实现接触丰富的灵巧控制。

6
00:01:47,150 --> 00:02:11,240
Official tasks and recovery demonstrations turn contact-rich skills into reusable evidence.
官方任务与恢复演示，把接触丰富的技能整理成可复用证据。

7
00:02:11,740 --> 00:02:36,790
Data becomes policy, policy becomes physics, and physics becomes a result.
数据形成策略，策略进入物理，物理运行产生结果。

8
00:02:37,290 --> 00:03:01,780
DISCOVERSE carries expert paths, policy experiments, and multi-view replay onto AMD.
DISCOVERSE 将专家轨迹、策略实验和多视角回放带到 AMD。

9
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:23,190
3D Gaussian Splatting adds high-fidelity rendering and dynamic replay.
3D Gaussian Splatting 带来高保真渲染与动态回放。

10
00:03:23,690 --> 00:03:49,180
ROCm versions, GPU metrics, videos, JSON, and SHA travel with every result.
ROCm 版本、GPU 指标、视频、JSON 与 SHA 随结果保存。

11
00:03:49,680 --> 00:04:12,870
Selected successes lead the story, with every result linked to its source artifact.
精选成功案例先行，每项结果都链接到原始产物。

12
00:04:13,370 --> 00:04:38,630
Recovery traces show how alignment, navigation, contact, and release shape performance.
恢复轨迹展示动作对齐、导航、接触与释放如何影响表现。

13
00:04:39,130 --> 00:04:58,630
Code, notebooks, weights, reports, videos, and commands make the work reusable.
代码、Notebook、权重、报告、视频与命令，让成果可以复用。
